### =========================
### Create a new course
### =========================
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "course": {
    "name": "Beginner Archery",
    "animalIds": {{create_course_animal_ids}}
  }
}
> {%
  console.log("Post course response:\n", response.body);
%}

### =========================
